	<!--
	Long tail OUTLINE abstract: the greyscale Long_Tail texture, same convention as GeneDef_Cheech_Tail_Cheechy. Long_Tail is drawn in the same canvas frame as Cheechy_Tail (base end at the top,
	tip on the curl), so drawData is Cheechy's with the small base-end difference subtracted out, putting the root on the same body attach point. bodyTypeOffsets copied from Cheechy.
	-->
